- # `↯/s.73.10` — `Timezone.Error`
+ # `↯/s.73.10` — `Timezone.Error`

- Raised when a value does not name a known timezone.
+ Levée lorsqu'une valeur ne nomme pas un fuseau horaire connu.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- Aviation looks timezones up by IANA name (e.g. `Europe/Paris`). When
- the name is not present in the loaded TZDB, this error is thrown.
+ Aviation recherche les fuseaux horaires par leur nom IANA (par exemple
+ `Europe/Paris`). Lorsque le nom est absent de la TZDB chargée, cette erreur est
+ lancée.

- ## Example message
+ ## Exemple de message

=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone
+ [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone

= [↯/s.73.10] the name Mars/Olympus does not refer to a known timezone
- ```
+ ```

- ## Resolution
+ ## Résolution

- Use a name from the TZDB; for legacy abbreviations (`PST`, `EST`)
- prefer the corresponding IANA zone (`America/Los_Angeles`,
+ Utilisez un nom de la TZDB ; pour les abréviations héritées (`PST`, `EST`),
+ préférez la zone IANA correspondante (`America/Los_Angeles`,

- `America/New_York`).
+ `America/New_York`).

